B.z7=new A.vG("The hard part is not the search UI, it is knowing who has the drug. Three scrapers feed the database (OSM maps every pharmacy, a public Telegram group posts daily availability, Sudan Codex supplies the drug catalog), a matcher links messy drug text to a real product, and then pharmacies rank by the number and recency of Telegram reports and community confirmations. Dawaa asks for a check-in after a user leaves a pharmacy\u2019s 100 m zone.",B.mM,B.za,B.KH,B.ze)
B.zl=new A.qi("Dawaa","Khartoum has no pharmacy inventory API, so patients cannot know which nearby pharmacy has a medicine before calling or visiting. Dawaa ranks pharmacies with a 1-10 certainty score based on the number and recency of Telegram reports and community check-ins. After a user leaves a pharmacy\u2019s 100 m zone, Dawaa asks whether they found the medicine.","Flutter \xb7 Supabase \xb7 OSM \xb7 Telegram \xb7 OCR",B.ko,B.M_,null,null,null,B.z7,!0)
