B.zp=new A.qk("Driver Copy Slip Extraction","Email \u2192 OCR \u2192 Structured records","Weight slips arrive as email PDFs, and every one gets read by hand and filed into truck folders manually. This workflow reads the driver copy with OCR, extracts the item, date, plate and net weight, files the PDF into the right Google Drive folder, and logs a structured row \u2014 zero manual entry.",B.LW)
