B.zq=new A.qk("Item Price Check","Photo \u2192 price list reply","Comparing a product's price across KSA stores means opening five shopping apps. Send a bot a photo of the product and it identifies it with vision AI, finds each store's product page, scrapes the live prices and replies with one compiled list.",B.Jf)
